OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of heavy and thundery
OL,6,Frain will soon clear eastwards. The
OL,7,Frest of the day will be mainly dry
OL,8,Fwith bright spells and scattered
OL,9,Fshowers. Feeling cooler than Thursday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBright spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening. Mostly dry
OL,13,Fovernight with clear spells but the
OL,14,Fodd shower will move in from the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,17,Fweather across Glasgow and the south.
OL,18,FCloudier across Argyll with a few
OL,19,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
